    "name": "PACK MY STUFF",
    "steam_appid": 1889450,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889450/extras/05b7473aaf1ede3d8e8e91169a31aa93.poster.avif?t=1689079858\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889450/extras/05b7473aaf1ede3d8e8e91169a31aa93.webm?t=1689079858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>PACK MY STUFF</strong> is an engaging puzzle and hidden object game. Your task is to locate and pack all the objects in the room into boxes. It's a simple concept, but incredibly enjoyable. As a dedicated employee of a moving company, you'll assist the residents of Neuberg in their relocation by carefully packing their belongings into moving boxes. Immerse yourself in a vibrant and refreshing click game that offers an idyllic experience. Take a break from the demands of everyday life and enjoy a few relaxing rounds of <strong>PACK MY STUFF</strong>.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889450/extras/story_.png?t=1689079858\" /></div><br><br>As an employee of a moving company, you play a vital role in helping the residents of Neuberg pack their cherished belongings. Uncover new secrets and treasures along the way, while documenting your own journey in a personal diary. Immerse yourself in the captivating world of PACK MY STUFF, set in a charming small town in America.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889450/extras/96103d31da7360cf3516430417f7cdb7.avif?t=1689079858\" /></div><br><br>The controls in PACK MY STUFF are simple and easy to learn, allowing you to dive right into the fun. Your objective is to pack all the items in each level to successfully complete it. Don't forget to stay vigilant for hidden treasures and secrets throughout your journey. With a wide range of locations to explore, from cozy family homes to sprawling warehouses, you'll have plenty of variety. Discover the essence of middle-class American homes and assist in packing up small and large corporate offices, all while immersing yourself in your own unique story.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889450/extras/8b6057e9d6634842619ccfd873667d99.poster.avif?t=1689079858\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889450/extras/8b6057e9d6634842619ccfd873667d99.webm?t=1689079858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889450/extras/8b6057e9d6634842619ccfd873667d99.mp4?t=1689079858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You like it hard! [/b]<br>then use our hard mode where you have no help. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889450/extras/b82b858561594ee7a4adc21a57f0156f.avif?t=1689079858\" /></div><br>Welcome to Newhill, a picturesque American dream town where dreams come to life. Join us in helping the residents pack up their belongings, paving the way for a seamless transition into their new apartment. Be a part of their journey and make their dream move a reality.<br><br>Cool new Box Skins to earn<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889450/extras/a63e560d9fb6ccbcf4ccc8fdc660d752.poster.avif?t=1689079858\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889450/extras/a63e560d9fb6ccbcf4ccc8fdc660d752.webm?t=1689079858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889450/extras/a63e560d9fb6ccbcf4ccc8fdc660d752.mp4?t=1689079858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience a simple and yet fun gameplay<br><br></li><li>Pack all objects on the map ei negla bo tables or PCs.<br><br></li><li>Visits place like family homes, offices, warehouses, gardens and much more<br><br></li><li>Find our Secrets and unlock achievements<br></li></ul>",
